{"logId": "ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（三）经营标准——环境", "block_bbox": [138, 87, 422, 120], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[138.0, 87.0], [422.0, 87.0], [422.0, 120.0], [138.0, 120.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "环境：安全、品质、方便、文明", "block_bbox": [127, 199, 476, 229], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[127.0, 199.0], [476.0, 199.0], [476.0, 229.0], [127.0, 229.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "① 安全：具备安全防范思想意识，从卖场设计氛围、商品陈列道具、设备设施的使用，到后勤消防、用电、防损、施工等各方面，在不低于国家标准的基础上，制定完善、专业的安全标准体系及应急预案，不断优化建设，规避隐患及事故发生。为顾客提供放心、温馨的购物环境，为员工提供安全、有序的工作环境，保证部门运营环境安全，保障企业健康稳步发展！", "block_bbox": [126, 249, 805, 419], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[126.0, 249.0], [805.0, 249.0], [805.0, 419.0], [126.0, 419.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "② 品质：有追求品质和价值的思想格局，净心做好品质，享受创造品质的过程，对门店环境、硬件设施及配件、工程施工、工艺流程等品质标准有严格的要求，往百年传承的品质工艺、国际化标准的品质工艺、艺术作品的品质工艺上进步！体现匠心、质感，创造品牌价值，成就品质的行业及社会环境！", "block_bbox": [127, 428, 806, 562], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[127.0, 428.0], [806.0, 428.0], [806.0, 562.0], [127.0, 562.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [814, 239, 1099, 562], "block_id": 4, "block_order": null, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[814.0, 239.0], [1099.0, 239.0], [1099.0, 562.0], [814.0, 562.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（三）经营标准——环境", "block_bbox": [138, 702, 422, 736], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[138.0, 702.0], [422.0, 702.0], [422.0, 736.0], [138.0, 736.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "环境：安全、品质、方便、文明", "block_bbox": [198, 813, 541, 844], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 813.0], [541.0, 813.0], [541.0, 844.0], [198.0, 844.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "③ 方便：体现在卖场简洁的布局动线，便利且丰富的硬件功能设施，优选的、能满足不同人群需求的商品，贴心周到的人员服务等，各个方面为顾客提供方便，创造温馨舒适的购物环境。", "block_bbox": [198, 864, 623, 998], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 864.0], [623.0, 864.0], [623.0, 998.0], [198.0, 998.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "④文明：保障环境安全、品质、方便的同时，向顾客传递一种好的生活理念，引导并促进卖场文明的环境，和谐的人文，带动社会环境，影响更多的人往文明、美好的方向发展！", "block_bbox": [199, 1007, 624, 1142], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 1007.0], [624.0, 1007.0], [624.0, 1142.0], [199.0, 1142.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [638, 850, 1031, 1143], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[638.0, 850.0], [1031.0, 850.0], [1031.0, 1143.0], [638.0, 1143.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.85566645860672, "coordinate": [138, 87, 422, 120], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[138.0, 87.0], [422.0, 87.0], [422.0, 120.0], [138.0, 120.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8595999479293823, "coordinate": [127, 199, 476, 229], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[127.0, 199.0], [476.0, 199.0], [476.0, 229.0], [127.0, 229.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9485089182853699, "coordinate": [126, 249, 805, 419], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[126.0, 249.0], [805.0, 249.0], [805.0, 419.0], [126.0, 419.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9437876343727112, "coordinate": [127, 428, 806, 562], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[127.0, 428.0], [806.0, 428.0], [806.0, 562.0], [127.0, 562.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9708564877510071, "coordinate": [814, 239, 1099, 562], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[814.0, 239.0], [1099.0, 239.0], [1099.0, 562.0], [814.0, 562.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8536329865455627, "coordinate": [138, 702, 422, 736], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[138.0, 702.0], [422.0, 702.0], [422.0, 736.0], [138.0, 736.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8428879380226135, "coordinate": [198, 813, 541, 844], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 813.0], [541.0, 813.0], [541.0, 844.0], [198.0, 844.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9406401515007019, "coordinate": [198, 864, 623, 998], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 864.0], [623.0, 864.0], [623.0, 998.0], [198.0, 998.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.948930561542511, "coordinate": [199, 1007, 624, 1142], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 1007.0], [624.0, 1007.0], [624.0, 1142.0], [199.0, 1142.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9743562340736389, "coordinate": [638, 850, 1031, 1143], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[638.0, 850.0], [1031.0, 850.0], [1031.0, 1143.0], [638.0, 1143.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## （三） 经营标准——环境\n\n## 环境：安全、品质、方便、文明\n\n① 安全：具备安全防范思想意识，从卖场设计氛围、商品陈列道具、设备设施的使用，到后勤消防、用电、防损、施工等各方面，在不低于国家标准的基础上，制定完善、专业的安全标准体系及应急预案，不断优化建设，规避隐患及事故发生。为顾客提供放心、温馨的购物环境，为员工提供安全、有序的工作环境，保证部门运营环境安全，保障企业健康稳步发展！\n\n② 品质：有追求品质和价值的思想格局，净心做好品质，享受创造品质的过程，对门店环境、硬件设施及配件、工程施工、工艺流程等品质标准有严格的要求，往百年传承的品质工艺、国际化标准的品质工艺、艺术作品的品质工艺上进步！体现匠心、质感，创造品牌价值，成就品质的行业及社会环境！\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_814_239_1099_562.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"23%\" /></div>\n\n\n## （三） 经营标准——环境\n\n## 环境：安全、品质、方便、文明\n\n③ 方便：体现在卖场简洁的布局动线，便利且丰富的硬件功能设施，优选的、能满足不同人群需求的商品，贴心周到的人员服务等，各个方面为顾客提供方便，创造温馨舒适的购物环境。\n\n④文明：保障环境安全、品质、方便的同时，向顾客传递一种好的生活理念，引导并促进卖场文明的环境，和谐的人文，带动社会环境，影响更多的人往文明、美好的方向发展！\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_638_850_1031_1143.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"33%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_814_239_1099_562.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_814_239_1099_562.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2F75ce19093b491a30b42f6e53a834716c54f4b22b31debc84a0f46969c8684bc2", "imgs/img_in_image_box_638_850_1031_1143.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_638_850_1031_1143.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2F7d815f2248620f461f92932592596483d319989d9739545577cd274b2cb21c72"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2F449f7a9d564bb614b5b42042fa7d2d4e7e5356416c2aa48742462974bf94ce23"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2Fb385d1d51e61695e456b8e32023a9a1f6d553a67d01f15d7161571bc25ebd285"}, {"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（三）经营标准——人员", "block_bbox": [138, 87, 421, 120], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[138.0, 87.0], [421.0, 87.0], [421.0, 120.0], [138.0, 120.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "人员：真诚、热情、专业、净心", "block_bbox": [170, 230, 516, 262], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[170.0, 230.0], [516.0, 230.0], [516.0, 262.0], [170.0, 262.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "① 真诚：具备善良真诚的品格素养，有宽广的胸怀和成人之美的心，从顾客、员工、厂家及供应商、到外来企业，以及对所有人和事物，做到尊重、理解与成就，真实的表达善意，坦诚相待。", "block_bbox": [180, 303, 708, 436], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[180.0, 303.0], [708.0, 303.0], [708.0, 436.0], [180.0, 436.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "②热情：对待顾客的热情、对待工作的热情、对待生活的热情，体现自信阳光的状态与精神面貌，主动释放身上的能量，感染并传递更多温暖和力量，创造美好价值！", "block_bbox": [181, 445, 708, 544], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 445.0], [708.0, 445.0], [708.0, 544.0], [181.0, 544.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [799, 288, 1016, 552], "block_id": 4, "block_order": null, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[799.0, 288.0], [1016.0, 288.0], [1016.0, 552.0], [799.0, 552.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（三）经营标准——人员", "block_bbox": [137, 702, 422, 736], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[137.0, 702.0], [422.0, 702.0], [422.0, 736.0], [137.0, 736.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "人员：真诚、热情、专业、净心", "block_bbox": [124, 853, 467, 886], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[124.0, 853.0], [467.0, 853.0], [467.0, 886.0], [124.0, 886.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "③专业：成就专业、科学、成熟的团队，具备本岗位的专业能力，了解工作涉及范围内的国家标准及国际标准，有不断往专业化、国际化方向学习进步的格局和能力，坚定“本岗位专家”的目标，为社会做出贡献。", "block_bbox": [122, 918, 650, 1052], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[122.0, 918.0], [650.0, 918.0], [650.0, 1052.0], [122.0, 1052.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "④ 净心：因喜欢而专注、投入的工作状态，认真严谨的工作习惯，不骄傲、不浮躁，注重做事细节与品质，乐在其中享受做事的过程，通过对本职工作不断的精进、主动学习与钻研，体现团队的匠心、净心。", "block_bbox": [123, 1061, 649, 1195], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[123.0, 1061.0], [649.0, 1061.0], [649.0, 1195.0], [123.0, 1195.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [696, 903, 1094, 1199], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[696.0, 903.0], [1094.0, 903.0], [1094.0, 1199.0], [696.0, 1199.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8159635663032532, "coordinate": [138, 87, 421, 120], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[138.0, 87.0], [421.0, 87.0], [421.0, 120.0], [138.0, 120.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7945567965507507, "coordinate": [170, 230, 516, 262], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[170.0, 230.0], [516.0, 230.0], [516.0, 262.0], [170.0, 262.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9410509467124939, "coordinate": [180, 303, 708, 436], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[180.0, 303.0], [708.0, 303.0], [708.0, 436.0], [180.0, 436.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9276372790336609, "coordinate": [181, 445, 708, 544], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[181.0, 445.0], [708.0, 445.0], [708.0, 544.0], [181.0, 544.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.6453307867050171, "coordinate": [800, 287, 906, 427], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[800.0, 287.0], [906.0, 287.0], [906.0, 427.0], [800.0, 427.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.3513360023498535, "coordinate": [799, 288, 1016, 552], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[799.0, 288.0], [1016.0, 288.0], [1016.0, 552.0], [799.0, 552.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.6416302919387817, "coordinate": [911, 290, 1016, 428], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[911.0, 290.0], [1016.0, 290.0], [1016.0, 428.0], [911.0, 428.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.638394832611084, "coordinate": [801, 432, 906, 551], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[801.0, 432.0], [906.0, 432.0], [906.0, 551.0], [801.0, 551.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.6282366514205933, "coordinate": [910, 433, 1016, 549], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[910.0, 433.0], [1016.0, 433.0], [1016.0, 549.0], [910.0, 549.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8282114863395691, "coordinate": [137, 702, 422, 736], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[137.0, 702.0], [422.0, 702.0], [422.0, 736.0], [137.0, 736.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7169135808944702, "coordinate": [124, 853, 467, 886], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[124.0, 853.0], [467.0, 853.0], [467.0, 886.0], [124.0, 886.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.944949746131897, "coordinate": [122, 918, 650, 1052], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[122.0, 918.0], [650.0, 918.0], [650.0, 1052.0], [122.0, 1052.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9484394192695618, "coordinate": [123, 1061, 649, 1195], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[123.0, 1061.0], [649.0, 1061.0], [649.0, 1195.0], [123.0, 1195.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9667425751686096, "coordinate": [696, 903, 1094, 1199], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[696.0, 903.0], [1094.0, 903.0], [1094.0, 1199.0], [696.0, 1199.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## （三） 经营标准——人员\n\n## 人员：真诚、热情、专业、净心\n\n① 真诚：具备善良真诚的品格素养，有宽广的胸怀和成人之美的心，从顾客、员工、厂家及供应商、到外来企业，以及对所有人和事物，做到尊重、理解与成就，真实的表达善意，坦诚相待。\n\n②热情：对待顾客的热情、对待工作的热情、对待生活的热情，体现自信阳光的状态与精神面貌，主动释放身上的能量，感染并传递更多温暖和力量，创造美好价值！\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_799_288_1016_552.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"18%\" /></div>\n\n\n## （三） 经营标准——人员\n\n## 人员：真诚、热情、专业、净心\n\n③专业：成就专业、科学、成熟的团队，具备本岗位的专业能力，了解工作涉及范围内的国家标准及国际标准，有不断往专业化、国际化方向学习进步的格局和能力，坚定“本岗位专家”的目标，为社会做出贡献。\n\n④ 净心：因喜欢而专注、投入的工作状态，认真严谨的工作习惯，不骄傲、不浮躁，注重做事细节与品质，乐在其中享受做事的过程，通过对本职工作不断的精进、主动学习与钻研，体现团队的匠心、净心。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_696_903_1094_1199.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"33%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_799_288_1016_552.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_1/imgs/img_in_image_box_799_288_1016_552.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2F2b6093d7154c08098f717302afe08b1a96da2aba8f393b194378a6d83bfc6ce4", "imgs/img_in_image_box_696_903_1094_1199.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_1/imgs/img_in_image_box_696_903_1094_1199.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2F0aba2b9ca6d9a20a4a14082987a2fb77daa60b1c08c48b1db8aaa4736f484d08", "imgs/img_in_image_box_800_287_906_427.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_1/imgs/img_in_image_box_800_287_906_427.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2F135ab24bcc114b09e43f88d7e64cd5c9139a40da0f231bd3965124800cb9b5f5", "imgs/img_in_image_box_911_290_1016_428.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_1/imgs/img_in_image_box_911_290_1016_428.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2F7a132a2452e91ff15e18f46837b17204b4b41f2b147275fa1f1f1e0623dc7bf4", "imgs/img_in_image_box_801_432_906_551.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_1/imgs/img_in_image_box_801_432_906_551.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2F4482d9266899db7a9c140fb124fe153ea1df086d20d6428b5804ec7edd4d1e59", "imgs/img_in_image_box_910_433_1016_549.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_1/imgs/img_in_image_box_910_433_1016_549.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc9ea6c71c9c745628f54cb71453fb374d09f471bdb4ddbb6a48e3e39fb1c1b1e"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/layout_det_res_1.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2F37955cc5072db862da6546181019f8bd244b20bcbabeb66d0b6df4b3bf74ac5b"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/input_img_1.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2Fdff616453d65812cca1be6b33039b925a200b2d4428c3ece9e74bfa43a82fafa"}, {"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（三）经营标准——服务", "block_bbox": [136, 86, 423, 122], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[136.0, 86.0], [423.0, 86.0], [423.0, 122.0], [136.0, 122.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "服务：公平、个性、专业、主动", "block_bbox": [204, 198, 557, 232], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[204.0, 198.0], [557.0, 198.0], [557.0, 232.0], [204.0, 232.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "不背负销售的责任，\n不做促销和宣传，\n真诚、实在的做好自己。\n① 公平：以平等、尊重、真诚为服务原则，在国家法律及公司标准制度范围内，为顾客提供合理的服务，实事求是的处理解决问题，不过度服务、不取悦顾客，体现公平公正、相互理解，保障顾客及员工应有的权益，维护企业品牌形象。", "block_bbox": [249, 311, 380, 369], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[249.0, 311.0], [380.0, 311.0], [380.0, 369.0], [249.0, 369.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [465, 257, 1070, 394], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[465.0, 257.0], [1070.0, 257.0], [1070.0, 394.0], [465.0, 394.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [235, 291, 428, 578], "block_id": 4, "block_order": null, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[235.0, 291.0], [428.0, 291.0], [428.0, 578.0], [235.0, 578.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "② 个性：保证提供公平、合理服务的基础上，从卖场配置的便民服务设施、人文购物环境、再到品质及功能优选，价格实实在在的商品等，在各项细节中体现胖东来特色及企业文化理念，彰显个性化服务。不断优化创新，为社会带来更具个性的、展现胖东来文化的环境氛围。", "block_bbox": [465, 408, 1064, 580], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[465.0, 408.0], [1064.0, 408.0], [1064.0, 580.0], [465.0, 580.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（三）经营标准——服务", "block_bbox": [135, 701, 423, 737], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[135.0, 701.0], [423.0, 701.0], [423.0, 737.0], [135.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "服务：公平、个性、专业、主动", "block_bbox": [231, 813, 576, 847], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[231.0, 813.0], [576.0, 813.0], [576.0, 847.0], [231.0, 847.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "DÍ", "block_bbox": [247, 875, 328, 898], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[247.0, 875.0], [327.0, 875.0], [327.0, 897.0], [247.0, 897.0]]}, {"block_label": "vision_footnote", "block_content": "品德和专业能力的不断进步，\n让我们更好的成就自己", "block_bbox": [287, 956, 420, 1011], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[287.0, 956.0], [420.0, 956.0], [420.0, 1011.0], [287.0, 1011.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [245, 948, 452, 1195], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[245.0, 948.0], [452.0, 948.0], [452.0, 1195.0], [245.0, 1195.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "③ 专业：各方面体现服务顾客的专业度，学习并掌握本岗位相关工作专业知识、商品专业知识，为顾客做专业准确解答，引导顾客好的生活方式，提供专业的优质服务。", "block_bbox": [522, 872, 967, 1009], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[522.0, 872.0], [967.0, 872.0], [967.0, 1009.0], [522.0, 1009.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "④ 主动：积极热情的工作状态及服务态度，不漠视、不敷衍，具备耐心和真诚，照顾到顾客购物情绪，能站在顾客立场思考，细心的发现并满足顾客需求，主动为顾客做好服务，传递分享爱和关怀。", "block_bbox": [522, 1023, 969, 1196], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[522.0, 1023.0], [969.0, 1023.0], [969.0, 1196.0], [522.0, 1196.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8167815804481506, "coordinate": [136, 86, 423, 122], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[136.0, 86.0], [423.0, 86.0], [423.0, 122.0], [136.0, 122.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8458067178726196, "coordinate": [204, 198, 557, 232], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[204.0, 198.0], [557.0, 198.0], [557.0, 232.0], [204.0, 232.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.48373153805732727, "coordinate": [249, 311, 380, 369], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[249.0, 311.0], [380.0, 311.0], [380.0, 369.0], [249.0, 369.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.3444080054759979, "coordinate": [235, 291, 428, 578], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[235.0,