[281.0, 1031.0], [275.0, 1039.0], [269.0, 1055.0], [269.0, 1095.0], [269.0, 1104.0], [269.0, 1193.0], [321.0, 1193.0], [380.0, 1193.0], [426.0, 1193.0], [432.0, 1185.0], [437.0, 1062.0], [437.0, 1031.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9333862066268921, "coordinate": [522, 872, 967, 1009], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[522.0, 872.0], [967.0, 872.0], [967.0, 1009.0], [522.0, 1009.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9427616000175476, "coordinate": [522, 1023, 969, 1196], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[522.0, 1023.0], [969.0, 1023.0], [969.0, 1196.0], [522.0, 1196.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## （三） 经营标准——服务\n\n## 服务：公平、个性、专业、主动\n\n不背负销售的责任，\n\n不做促销和宣传，\n\n真诚、实在的做好自己。\n\n① 公平：以平等、尊重、真诚为服务原则，在国家法律及公司标准制度范围内，为顾客提供合理的服务，实事求是的处理解决问题，不过度服务、不取悦顾客，体现公平公正、相互理解，保障顾客及员工应有的权益，维护企业品牌形象。\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_235_291_428_578.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"16%\" /></div>\n\n\n② 个性：保证提供公平、合理服务的基础上，从卖场配置的便民服务设施、人文购物环境、再到品质及功能优选，价格实实在在的商品等，在各项细节中体现胖东来特色及企业文化理念，彰显个性化服务。不断优化创新，为社会带来更具个性的、展现胖东来文化的环境氛围。\n\n## （三） 经营标准——服务\n\n## 服务：公平、个性、专业、主动\n\nDÍ\n\n品德和专业能力的不断进步，\n\n让我们更好的成就自己\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_245_948_452_1195.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"17%\" /></div>\n\n\n③ 专业：各方面体现服务顾客的专业度，学习并掌握本岗位相关工作专业知识、商品专业知识，为顾客做专业准确解答，引导顾客好的生活方式，提供专业的优质服务。\n\n④ 主动：积极热情的工作状态及服务态度，不漠视、不敷衍，具备耐心和真诚，照顾到顾客购物情绪，能站在顾客立场思考，细心的发现并满足顾客需求，主动为顾客做好服务，传递分享爱和关怀。", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_235_291_428_578.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_2/imgs/img_in_image_box_235_291_428_578.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff81c119f976f4a55b87b3aae28ae5ed3e267d2d054078f8b3faa252f8122b101", "imgs/img_in_image_box_245_948_452_1195.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_2/imgs/img_in_image_box_245_948_452_1195.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2F4c56e0e2211dfa664148fab66bcb098429d715ef5816525970db67174b4c42aa", "imgs/img_in_image_box_261_398_358_488.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_2/imgs/img_in_image_box_261_398_358_488.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2F1bdc250c267e8c0433ad3c345a535621780ef360b20d1140806697d1f76dadde", "imgs/img_in_image_box_255_396_372_563.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_2/imgs/img_in_image_box_255_396_372_563.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2F0f01f84d69f7e49f768550b65212d0228011c7891ce9db3ff5baf8ff0da11b0b", "imgs/img_in_image_box_269_1022_438_1194.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_2/imgs/img_in_image_box_269_1022_438_1194.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2F124c769f16c700f390b98f3fff0f7a6096eee7a03eae41075b94e6af9f8d9ace"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/layout_det_res_2.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2Fe439ac20c8e39ae8f27e105d93f52fd2cc66c9ac7968a418f64661332fddea27"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/input_img_2.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2F349455ec39310ee449b1547622b683f2f1b94ee3e206912d47083bbfc5b893c2"}, {"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（三）经营标准——系统", "block_bbox": [138, 87, 422, 120], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[138.0, 87.0], [422.0, 87.0], [422.0, 120.0], [138.0, 120.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "系统：科学化、数字化、智能化、与时俱进", "block_bbox": [183, 212, 591, 242], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[183.0, 212.0], [591.0, 212.0], [591.0, 242.0], [183.0, 242.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "具备与时俱进的思想和能力、学习了解当下先进技术与科技的发展，跟得上时代的步伐，将数字化、智能化的先进技术运用到卖场运营、后勤管理、物流配送等各个方面的系统支持上。通过不断进步与提升，实现高效、便捷、科学的操作系统及环境状态，辅助经营，引领顾客时尚消费观念与生活品质。", "block_bbox": [184, 287, 591, 530], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[184.0, 287.0], [591.0, 287.0], [591.0, 530.0], [184.0, 530.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [619, 277, 1060, 536], "block_id": 3, "block_order": null, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[619.0, 277.0], [1060.0, 277.0], [1060.0, 536.0], [619.0, 536.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "（三）经营标准——系统", "block_bbox": [138, 702, 423, 736], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[138.0, 702.0], [423.0, 702.0], [423.0, 736.0], [138.0, 736.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "系统：科学化、数字化、智能化、与时俱进", "block_bbox": [130, 827, 584, 859], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[130.0, 827.0], [584.0, 827.0], [584.0, 859.0], [130.0, 859.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "① 科学化：不凭经验做事，具备创新意识和能力，以科学理性的思维和方法，进行系统的客观分析、评估，并有效的解决问题，规避系统存在的风险，健康开展运营系统的运用及管理、升级与优化。", "block_bbox": [134, 895, 700, 1028], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[134.0, 895.0], [700.0, 895.0], [700.0, 1028.0], [134.0, 1028.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "② 数字化：将系统中标准模糊的、不量化的工作内容，运用数据和技术来支撑运转，做精准、清晰的梳理，提高人员的效率，精细化的管理，方便在工作中进行系统的分析优化。", "block_bbox": [135, 1037, 700, 1137], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[135.0, 1037.0], [700.0, 1037.0], [700.0, 1137.0], [135.0, 1137.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [779, 881, 1052, 1153], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[779.0, 881.0], [1052.0, 881.0], [1052.0, 1153.0], [779.0, 1153.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8386444449424744, "coordinate": [138, 87, 422, 120], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[138.0, 87.0], [422.0, 87.0], [422.0, 120.0], [138.0, 120.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7354397773742676, "coordinate": [183, 212, 591, 242], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[183.0, 212.0], [591.0, 212.0], [591.0, 242.0], [183.0, 242.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9470924139022827, "coordinate": [184, 287, 591, 530], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[184.0, 287.0], [591.0, 287.0], [591.0, 530.0], [184.0, 530.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9418615698814392, "coordinate": [619, 277, 1060, 536], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[619.0, 277.0], [1060.0, 277.0], [1060.0, 536.0], [619.0, 536.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8543646335601807, "coordinate": [138, 702, 423, 736], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[138.0, 702.0], [423.0, 702.0], [423.0, 736.0], [138.0, 736.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8291358947753906, "coordinate": [130, 827, 584, 859], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[130.0, 827.0], [584.0, 827.0], [584.0, 859.0], [130.0, 859.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9429773688316345, "coordinate": [134, 895, 700, 1028], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[134.0, 895.0], [700.0, 895.0], [700.0, 1028.0], [134.0, 1028.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9383373260498047, "coordinate": [135, 1037, 700, 1137], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[135.0, 1037.0], [700.0, 1037.0], [700.0, 1137.0], [135.0, 1137.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.970734715461731, "coordinate": [779, 881, 1052, 1153], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[779.0, 881.0], [1052.0, 881.0], [1052.0, 1153.0], [779.0, 1153.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## （三） 经营标准——系统\n\n## 系统：科学化、数字化、智能化、与时俱进\n\n具备与时俱进的思想和能力、学习了解当下先进技术与科技的发展，跟得上时代的步伐，将数字化、智能化的先进技术运用到卖场运营、后勤管理、物流配送等各个方面的系统支持上。通过不断进步与提升，实现高效、便捷、科学的操作系统及环境状态，辅助经营，引领顾客时尚消费观念与生活品质。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_619_277_1060_536.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"37%\" /></div>\n\n\n## （三） 经营标准——系统\n\n## 系统：科学化、数字化、智能化、与时俱进\n\n① 科学化：不凭经验做事，具备创新意识和能力，以科学理性的思维和方法，进行系统的客观分析、评估，并有效的解决问题，规避系统存在的风险，健康开展运营系统的运用及管理、升级与优化。\n\n② 数字化：将系统中标准模糊的、不量化的工作内容，运用数据和技术来支撑运转，做精准、清晰的梳理，提高人员的效率，精细化的管理，方便在工作中进行系统的分析优化。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_779_881_1052_1153.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"22%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_619_277_1060_536.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09dac676f34f/markdown_3/imgs/img_in_image_box_619_277_1060_536.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A08Z%2F-1%2F%2F793028bad137f10141ed334b07ed7b0d899934c112dea42bfb7feb1ed4b44734", "imgs/img_in_image_box_779_881_1052_1153.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ac162381-c806-44e2-915f-09da