], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[79.0, 699.0], [468.0, 699.0], [468.0, 1227.0], [79.0, 1227.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "企业理念", "block_bbox": [531, 770, 710, 817], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[531.0, 770.0], [710.0, 770.0], [710.0, 817.0], [531.0, 817.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "Freedom · Love", "block_bbox": [531, 832, 696, 858], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[531.0, 832.0], [696.0, 832.0], [696.0, 858.0], [531.0, 858.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "企业理念是灯塔的光，指引着我们前行的方向\n企业理念是智慧的根，输送着成长的阳光与能量\n如果我们偏离或者背弃它\n就像迷途的航船，没有目标的在黑暗中摸索徘徊\n就像沙漠的树木，缺乏养分而慢慢地干枯死亡\n企业理念是我们的企业梦想\n是我们的企业生命，我们要执着的去追寻它、实现它！", "block_bbox": [528, 897, 1051, 1144], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[528.0, 897.0], [1051.0, 897.0], [1051.0, 1144.0], [528.0, 1144.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8199479579925537, "coordinate": [138, 87, 422, 120], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[138.0, 87.0], [422.0, 87.0], [422.0, 120.0], [138.0, 120.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.975071907043457, "coordinate": [179, 200, 441, 596], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[179.0, 200.0], [441.0, 200.0], [441.0, 596.0], [179.0, 596.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.75115966796875, "coordinate": [461, 203, 923, 236], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[461.0, 203.0], [923.0, 203.0], [923.0, 236.0], [461.0, 236.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9264162182807922, "coordinate": [462, 267, 1028, 366], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[462.0, 267.0], [1028.0, 267.0], [1028.0, 366.0], [462.0, 366.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.942582368850708, "coordinate": [461, 422, 1027, 593], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[461.0, 422.0], [1027.0, 422.0], [1027.0, 593.0], [461.0, 593.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.8127725720405579, "coordinate": [79, 699, 468, 1227], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[79.0, 699.0], [468.0, 699.0], [468.0, 1227.0], [79.0, 1227.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6897215843200684, "coordinate": [531, 770, 710, 817], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[531.0, 770.0], [710.0, 770.0], [710.0, 817.0], [531.0, 817.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7383038401603699, "coordinate": [531, 832, 696, 858], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[531.0, 832.0], [696.0, 832.0], [696.0, 858.0], [531.0, 858.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.46134325861930847, "coordinate": [528, 895, 998, 997], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[528.0, 895.0], [998.0, 895.0], [998.0, 997.0], [528.0, 997.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.4742266833782196, "coordinate": [528, 897, 1051, 1144], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[528.0, 897.0], [1051.0, 897.0], [1051.0, 1144.0], [528.0, 1144.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.3840453028678894, "coordinate": [527, 1006, 1043, 1110], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[527.0, 1006.0], [1043.0, 1006.0], [1043.0, 1110.0], [527.0, 1110.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.3179287612438202, "coordinate": [529, 1118, 1051, 1145], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[529.0, 1118.0], [1051.0, 1118.0], [1051.0, 1145.0], [529.0, 1145.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## （三） 经营标准——系统\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_179_200_441_596.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"22%\" /></div>\n\n\n系统：科学化、数字化、智能化、与时俱进\n\n③ 智能化：运用先进的技术及设备，优化人员配置与技术，节省人力、物力等各方面资源投入，实现便捷、高效率的智能系统支持，辅助系统的运营更加健康、科学！\n\n④ 与时俱进：对现状及未来的发展，保持学习、进步的心态和与时俱进的能力，通过对行业市场、系统先进技术、未来时尚科技趋势的了解，在系统支持上做相应的规划与调整措施，思想和技术永远与时代同步前行，向更智慧、先进、品质与时尚的方向发展，引领顾客时尚消费观念、生活品质。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_79_699_468_1227.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"32%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 企业理念\n\nFreedom · Love\n\n企业理念是灯塔的光，指引着我们前行的方向\n\n企业理念是智慧的根，输送着成长的阳光与能量\n\n如果我们偏离或者背弃它\n\n就像迷途的航船，没有目标的在黑暗中摸索徘徊\n\n就像沙漠的树木，缺乏养分而慢慢地干枯死亡\n\n企业理念是我们的企业梦想\n\n是我们的企业生命，我们要执着的去追寻它、实现它！", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_179_200_441_596.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//4ab637e4-9645-4b8d-bd19-219b314ee570/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_179_200_441_596.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A06Z%2F-1%2F%2Fe532fa0cb73548dcdde85145a9f34f6d419a629021fe2d9c9da88edd59cc184b", "imgs/img_in_image_box_79_699_468_1227.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//4ab637e4-9645-4b8d-bd19-219b314ee570/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_79_699_468_1227.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A06Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff5349fbae8969275e45a98fc509696c85b364a3907e71b26ea2955e0a327dda0"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//4ab637e4-9645-4b8d-bd19-219b314ee570/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2Fb656ff676b67718df59bafbb7f169f45de0f525edbf360ea8b4393cfedf69f82"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//4ab637e4-9645-4b8d-bd19-219b314ee570/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T11%3A26%3A07Z%2F-1%2F%2F12e143b3f309c8b62b795c2bb49049a4c0fb728fce94126f0211ab6b9e5577ee"}, {"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": tr